      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As long as a user can choose if they show up on that, I like the idea. Maybe only if they're blue status? or a checkbox next to the usual status chooser to indicate if you want to announce.  Though this could be a problem since it would announce on join. If I want to hop on and not spam everyone about being online it'd be nice to have some way to do that even if I was last logged in publicly.\n\nPerhaps something on the initial loading screen for controlling status stuff?  But this would be another feature entirely I guess.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
